Review summaries of Gage errors and report issues

Gage is a coding-agent session analysis tool. Each note below summarizes the
errors one session met while using Gage tools and the `gage` command. The
notes describe what happened and do not judge the cause. Your task is to find
the Gage problems behind them and report each as an issue for the Gage
developers.

